{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d863efb79a7c7699","name":"Assassin Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-d863efb79a7c7699","title":"Assassin Talent Trees","revision":15945,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:28Z","sha256":"498888c6b605826803ddf541dc233aef76957e6882ca37f24cbcdabe9ca7bcf8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15945","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Assassin%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d863efb79a7c7699","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Assassin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Assassin","referenceId":"reference:c2d31bc82e366f1f"}," gains an additional Assassin Talent. An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Assassin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Assassin","referenceId":"reference:c2d31bc82e366f1f"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Assassin Talent Trees they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Assassin Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Misfortune Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Misfortune_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:572da85689e76d52"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Your mother always said you were trouble. Now, your enemies know it, too.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Malkite Poisoner Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malkite_Poisoner_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:126a3fbedee1f68d"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have mastered the deadly arts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," from the masters on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malkii"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malkii?action=edit&redlink=1"},". You can employ a wide array of lethal toxins with which you can quickly and efficiently destroy your targets.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Assassin Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Assassin_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:b0d8d24864b6a77f"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You do not fight fair. If you are ever caught in a straightforward fight, the odds are you are not going to make it, so your best move is to set up your attacks and use every trick at your disposal.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["GenoHaradan Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/GenoHaradan_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:a6e89c0f77f259ac"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The GenoHaradan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_GenoHaradan","referenceId":"reference:5f2da96a9a234322"}," are skilled not only in performing assassinations but also in manipulating others. An ancient organization dating back to the early days of the Republic, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The GenoHaradan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_GenoHaradan","referenceId":"reference:5f2da96a9a234322"}," are a clandestine group of assassins who pick their targets for political reason, though their true motives are rarely evident to those outside the organization.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
